## How to Run

1. Clone or download the repository.
2. Open the project in IntelliJ IDEA.
3. Make sure all Java files are in the same package.
4. Run `Main.java`.
5. View the output in the console.

## Storage

The project uses Java `ArrayList` collections for storing customer and product objects during program execution. Data is maintained in memory and is not permanently stored in a database.

